OL,3,ACatherine talks openly about how cancer
OL,4,Achanged her in documentary on BBC      
OL,6,FThe highly personal film, to be        
OL,7,Fscreened on BBC One on 29 November,    
OL,8,Fwill see Catherine share her           
OL,9,Fexperiences of cancer, saying: "Healing
OL,10,Fis a journey."                         
OL,12,FIt includes new footage of her         
OL,13,Fcompleting the Three Peaks Challenge   
OL,14,Fearlier this year, which involved      
OL,15,Fclimbing the highest peaks in England, 
OL,16,FScotland and Wales over a day.         
